WHAT THIS MEANS IN PRACTICE

1. PERSONAL AND NONCOMMERCIAL USE — FREE

   Use it, run it, study it, experiment with it. No permission needed and no
   cost. This covers individuals, and also charities, schools, universities,
   public research bodies and government institutions.

2. IF YOU MODIFY OR IMPROVE IT — KEEP THE ATTRIBUTION

   You are welcome to change this software and build on it for any permitted
   purpose. When you do, the Notices clause above requires that anyone who
   receives your version also receives these license terms (or their URL) and
   this line:

     Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026 kiannakazemi
                      (https://github.com/kiannakazemi)

   That obligation applies to modified versions and new works too, not only to
   verbatim copies. In addition, you are asked to state clearly that your
   version is modified and to describe what you changed, so that users can tell
   your work from the original.

   Improvements contributed back to the original repository are welcome.

3. COMMERCIAL OR PRODUCTION USE — ASK FIRST

   The license above does NOT permit commercial use. That includes, without
   limitation:

     - deploying this software as, or as part of, a paid product or service;
     - hosting it publicly on behalf of a company or for commercial benefit;
     - using it internally in a for-profit organization's operations;
     - incorporating it into anything you sell or license to others.

   For any of the above, please get in touch first. Commercial licenses are
   available and are normally straightforward to arrange.

     Email:  kianna.kazemi99@gmail.com
     GitHub: https://github.com/kiannakazemi/iran-prosperity-project-bilingual-rag/issues

   Email is the fastest route. Please include what you would like to build and
   the context you would use it in.

